      "message": "Here\u0027s the class loader context for the camera:\n\nclasspath \u003d PCL[]{PCL[/system/framework/android.hidl.manager-V1.0-java.jar*1256613519]{PCL[/system/framework/android.hidl.base-V1.0-java.jar*3447435217]}#PCL[/system/framework/android.hidl.base-V1.0-java.jar*3447435217]#PCL[/vendor/framework/com.google.android.camera.experimental2018.jar*770711896]}\n\nIt indicates that the manager has the base as it\u0027s parent.\nSo while this caching might \"work\" it will trigger an incorrect context at runtime. And I think you\u0027ll end up running the code from apks (you should be able to check this with showmaps and/or logcat).",
